usage: main.py run [-h] [--clean] [--no-export] [--build-root BUILD_ROOT]
                   [--work-root WORK_ROOT] [--filter FILTER] [--setup]
                   [--build] [--run] [--target TARGET] [--tool TOOL]
                   [--flag FLAG] [--resolve-env-vars-early]
                   [--system-name SYSTEM_NAME] [--allow-additional-properties]
                   [--lockfile LOCKFILE] [--mapping MAPPING]
                   system ...

positional arguments:
  system                Select a system to operate on
  backendargs           arguments to be sent to backend

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --clean               Clean build directory on start
  --no-export           Reference source files from their current location
                        instead of exporting to a build tree
  --build-root BUILD_ROOT
                        Output directory for build. VLNV will be appended
                        (defaults to build/)
  --work-root WORK_ROOT
                        Output directory for build. VLNV will not be appended
                        (overrides build-root)
  --filter FILTER       Add filter. Can be specified multiple times to add
                        multiple filters
  --setup               Execute setup stage
  --build               Execute build stage
  --run                 Execute run stage
  --target TARGET       Override default target
  --tool TOOL           Override default tool for target
  --flag FLAG           Set custom use flags. Can be specified multiple times
  --resolve-env-vars-early
                        Resolve environment variables in FuseSoC (defaults to
                        no resolution)
  --system-name SYSTEM_NAME
                        Override default VLNV name for system
  --allow-additional-properties
                        Allow additional properties in core files
  --lockfile LOCKFILE   Lockfile file path
  --mapping MAPPING     The VLNV of a core's mapping to apply.
